#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:2
msgid "How to un-manage an Instance/VM/Host"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:5
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:7
msgid ""
"A managed VM (and associated Instance) needs to be unmanaged and returned"
" to Discovered type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:10
msgid "Solution"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:12
msgid ""
"Delete the record from the ``Infrastructure > Compute`` (! not from "
"Provisioning - Instances) selection with the following configuration in "
"the Delete modal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:14
#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:46
msgid "``Remove Infrastructure`` UNCHECKED"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:15
#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:47
msgid ""
"``Remove Associated Instances`` Must be checked if the server has an "
"associated Instance, as deleting the VM but not the Instance would result"
" in an abandoned Instance thus not allowed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:16
#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:48
msgid "``Force Delete`` UNCHECKED"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:18
msgid ""
"The most important items to be aware of when \"un-managing\" an "
"Instance/VM/Host are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:20
msgid ""
"The \"Remove from Infrastructure\" flag when deleting a VM or Host in "
"|morpheus| determines if the actual VM is deleted from the target "
"Infrastructure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:22
msgid ""
"Checking \"Remove Infrastructure\" means you WANT TO DELETE THE ACTUAL "
"VM. Typing \"DELETE\" in the confirmation field is required when \"Remove"
" From Infrastructure\" is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:23
msgid ""
"Unchecking \"Remove Infrastructure\" means you only want to delete the "
"record in |morpheus| but leave the actual VM untouched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:25
msgid "Deleting an Instance will always remove Infrastructure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:27
#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:50
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:27
msgid ""
"REPEAT: Deleting an Instance from the ``Provisioning`` section will "
"always remove the VM aka Infrastructure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:29
msgid ""
"After removing the record from |morpheus|, the VM must be in a Cloud with"
" Inventory enabled to automatically be re-discovered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:32
msgid "Process"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:34
msgid ""
"Steps to delete a managed VM from |morpheus| and, when necessary, remove "
"the associated Instance:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:36
msgid ""
"Navigate to the VM (not Instance) detail page at ``Infrastructure > "
"Compute - VMs``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:38
#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:58
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:38
msgid ""
"VM's inside an Instance can be navigated to inside the Instance Details "
"page by selecting the VM in the ``VM's`` seciton on the Instance Details "
"page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:40
#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:52
msgid "Select :guilabel:`DELETE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:42
msgid "Configure the DELETE HOST modal with the following settings:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:44
msgid ".. image:: /images/delete_host_modal.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:50
msgid ""
"If you have to type DELETE that means the ``Remove Infrastructure`` flag "
"is selected and you are confirming deletion of the actual VM. Ensure "
"``Remove Infrastructure`` is UNCHECKED when you want to leave the VM "
"intact!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:54
msgid ""
"The VM and associated Insatnce will be removed from |morpheus| but the "
"actual VM will remain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:56
msgid ""
"Wait up to 5 min or click :guilabel:`REFRESH` on the associated Clouds "
"details page to force a cloud sync."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:58
msgid ""
"``Inventory`` must be enabled on the associated cloud for the VM to "
"automatically be re-discovered by |morpheus|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/How_To_Unmanage.rst:60
msgid ""
"The VM is now back in |morpheus| as discovered/unmanaged. To managed and "
"create a new Instance from the VM, select :guilabel:`ACTIONS` : Convert "
"To Managed."
msgstr ""

